{"title":"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Very_Slow_and_not_Recomended_for_use_in_the_real_AMC8)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Very Slow and not Recomended for use in the real AMC8)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87a8787ca8fcdf64f42e938d20fa64f63871646d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/e/56e228943301b048f242377b3b24717037d5996f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"11\" /> What percentage of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/3/ee326c993c95f1656496d2d74ca2270dd268c4c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"17\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/6/cc6547043664c2f58109922dbc9c50e3ec4ac321.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }5 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }35 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }75 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }133 \\frac13 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }300$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"420\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/2/ff20a47377d862d0a7a83dfd3ed5143d0f296714.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\% = \\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"37\" />, multiplying the given condition by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> shows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/0/f80b1fa9859e34f9f568c3314265da9d35b18997.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 \\cdot 5 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /> percent of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/8/6d8f8e9675091b6c67807f22cedce7360d82b43f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> (without loss of generality), the condition becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/8/8c8274755676841550dc90c53a83636ef3e7ca18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.15\\cdot 100 = 0.2\\cdot y \\Rightarrow 15 = \\frac{y}{5} \\Rightarrow y=75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"306\" height=\"33\" />. Clearly, it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e126f0d41c904d37ba2c332347a24b75d4ac3066.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/373d58b171613dfe7c712a1dfccbb5ec308fdf3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/7/697670e89cbc37f1a44f9513006dcfc8b16e31f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\%=\\frac{3}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"78\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/7/907da6175f5f6f9e10cc6733411cfa08bd13dd08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%=\\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73c70c2c19fa28b3cfc45f060e86d71f038c64fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{20}x=\\frac{1}{5}y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"79\" height=\"37\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we multiply by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/c/01c5a0303f5da7236abc1098397b0450137a1bc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{15}{20}x = \\frac{3}{4}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/373d58b171613dfe7c712a1dfccbb5ec308fdf3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c44149f33cbf255b640cb86ff32027bb1e33f5ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.15x = 0.20y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" />, so we may assume without loss of generality that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf1342f460285dfd226094ac3973558576c9982.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=20$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889e0b5ebc2bd86228677235c2b31785eec67c39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />. This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/a/93a7121be0c4bf636f4caff40f0d48c712a17520.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y}{x}=\\frac{15}{20}=\\frac{75}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"114\" height=\"38\" />, and thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/373d58b171613dfe7c712a1dfccbb5ec308fdf3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87a8787ca8fcdf64f42e938d20fa64f63871646d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/f/7ef63cc152fda541140a018c15b762f8572287be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.15x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77576522613e5920a1dc00dabd7ba9a1e637091.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.20y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />. We put <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/f/7ef63cc152fda541140a018c15b762f8572287be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.15x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77576522613e5920a1dc00dabd7ba9a1e637091.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.20y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" /> into an equation, creating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c44149f33cbf255b640cb86ff32027bb1e33f5ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.15x = 0.20y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/f/7ef63cc152fda541140a018c15b762f8572287be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.15x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77576522613e5920a1dc00dabd7ba9a1e637091.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.20y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/2/6a270a7be617f39b92e4821298c4555cffe496c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.2$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> to both sides, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/c/01c5a0303f5da7236abc1098397b0450137a1bc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{15}{20}x = \\frac{3}{4}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/373d58b171613dfe7c712a1dfccbb5ec308fdf3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87a8787ca8fcdf64f42e938d20fa64f63871646d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/2/852528f03b72fecca33fc3c949718ee19994b94d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15}{100}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/d/ddd1affea23ea3a60adbbcb458d9c519011da593.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15x}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"34\" height=\"38\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> can similarly be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/6/426c1b6ed6a301611cdb7f04e782295425633b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20}{100}y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/a/ffac32475e11b2c96168b498d9e5a21058fd328a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20y}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"30\" height=\"38\" />. So now, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dade19120fd3b07ee6c53d4710d7e7447653a32a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15x}{100} = \\frac{20y}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />. Using cross-multiplication, we can simplify the equation as: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/4/38400d21c4534d51020b5f8ce19fdf78574343e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1500x = 2000y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"17\" />. Dividing both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a39b14023c98c943554d150561aacc188c4ce26d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, we get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/5/465c681b8e3795ae8aa956b813302bf59445a878.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = 4y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"17\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> is the same thing as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e126f0d41c904d37ba2c332347a24b75d4ac3066.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/373d58b171613dfe7c712a1dfccbb5ec308fdf3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_.28Easy_to_understand.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bHNrBwwUCMI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bHNrBwwUCMI</a>\n</p><p>~NiuniuMaths\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=fRl03D9Q1KAdDtXz&amp;t=2346\">https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=fRl03D9Q1KAdDtXz&amp;t=2346</a> \n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Very_Slow_and_not_Recomended_for_use_in_the_real_AMC8.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Very_Slow_and_not_Recomended_for_use_in_the_real_AMC8)\">Video Solution (Very Slow and not Recomended for use in the real AMC8)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Very Slow and not Recomended for use in the real AMC8)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8LyGag4DOzo\">https://youtu.be/8LyGag4DOzo</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mjS-PHTw-GE\">https://youtu.be/mjS-PHTw-GE</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xjwDsaRE_Wo\">https://youtu.be/xjwDsaRE_Wo</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https: